title: Our Rimward Wing Decides
tags: event
view-if: threat_due_ready = 1 and threat_due_id = "rimward" and not game_ending
priority: 4
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_separatist.svg
on-arrival: {! SW.threatResolve(Q); !}

= Our Rimward Wing Decides

[? if threat_how = "leader" : [+ threat_leader +] has replaced [+ threat_old_leader +] at the head of the Rimward wing, and Dooku's emissaries are shown the door. ?][? if threat_how = "reform" : The Senate's new law for the Rim gives our Rimward senators something to point to. Dooku's emissaries are shown the door. ?][? if threat_how = "relations" : The Caucus has listened to its Rimward wing, and its senators have calmed. Dooku's emissaries are shown the door. ?][? if threat_how = "cooled" : The moment passes. Our Rimward senators stay, for now. ?][? if not threat_averted : Our Rimward wing defects to the Separatists. [? if threat_left_senate : Its senators leave the Senate with their worlds. ?][? if not threat_left_senate : Its senators take their seats with the Separatist Caucus. ?] Onaconda Farr and Riyo Chuchi will no longer advise us. Some of the Caucus's oldest friends are now its enemies. ?]
